# Web performance

When writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js in `packages/web`, follow `.cursor/skills/vercel-react-best-practices`.

Read individual rule files by category (`async-`, `bundle-`, `server-`, `rerender-`). Do not load all 70 rules at once.

## This repo

- Import public UI from `@smart-pantry/ui`. That barrel is the package API, not a third-party icon kit.
- For heavy third-party barrels (e.g. `lucide-react`), prefer Next `optimizePackageImports` — add it when those deps exist.
- Client state is Zustand, not SWR. Ignore `client-swr-dedup` until a client fetch cache is introduced.
- Prefer Server Components and small client islands (`web-layering`) before micro-optimizing re-renders.
